{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31032","headline":"戏题 · 薛能","name":"戏题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闪闪动鸣璫，初来烛影傍。\n拥头珠翠重，萦步绮罗长。\n静发歌如磬，连飘气觉香。\n不言微有笑，多媚总无妆。\n坐缺初离席，帘垂却入房。\n思惟不是梦，此会胜高唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}